From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Subject: [PATCH] t880: wait for natural VP9 picture completion

VP9 returns visible and synthesized reference-only pictures asynchronously
without future input. Reuse the existing bounded completion path and keep
CAPTURE active across independent keys instead of draining and replaying the
prefix for surface synchronization. Preserve framing, GPU fences, ownership,
explicit-drain restart and sticky failure handling.

Exercise the same delayed completion, continuous-key, drain, timeout, late
completion and invalid-payload tests for both no-lookahead codecs.

--- a/src/t880-decoder.cpp
+++ b/src/t880-decoder.cpp
@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@
 T880Decoder::T880Decoder(const std::string &device, unsigned width, unsigned height,
                          VAProfile profile, unsigned rt_format, int render_fd)
     : render_fd_(render_fd), width_(width), height_(height),
-      display_without_lookahead_(is_av1(profile)) {
+      display_without_lookahead_(is_av1(profile) || is_vp9(profile)) {
     check(rt_format == VA_RT_FORMAT_YUV420 && width >= 128 && height >= 128 && !(width & 1) &&
           !(height & 1) && width <= 4096 && height <= 2176 &&
           uint64_t(width) * height <= uint64_t(4096) * 2176,
@@ -398,7 +398,7 @@
     try {
         pump(0);
         if (!anchor.empty() && !history_.empty()) {
-            // AV1 can complete every old CLIENT without future input. Keep
+            // AV1 and VP9 complete every old CLIENT without future input. Keep
             // the active CAPTURE/DPB pool across independent keys; firmware
             // retires its own references while decoding the new key AU.
             if (display_without_lookahead_ && !drained_) {
@@ -433,7 +433,7 @@
         pump(0);
         if (s->pending) {
             wait_inputs(); pump(0);
-            // AV1 DISPLAY arrives asynchronously after compressed ownership
+            // DISPLAY arrives asynchronously after compressed ownership
             // returns. Wait for that completion; STOP would flush the DPB and
             // force prefix replay on the next picture. The operation deadline
             // stays fixed even if unrelated outputs arrive while pumping.
